OL,3,GNEWSALiam Neeson involved in new movie
OL,4,Arevealing story behind Tuam babies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe story of the amateur historian
OL,7,Fwhose research helped uncover the Tuam
OL,8,Fbabies scandal is being brought to the
OL,9,Fbig screen, with the help of actor Liam
OL,10,FNeeson.
OL,12,FThe Bon Secours Mother and Baby Home
OL,13,Finstitution for unmarried mothers and
OL,14,Ftheir children was in operation from
OL,15,F1925 until 1961.
OL,17,FIt came to international attention in
OL,18,F2014, after local historian Catherine
OL,19,FCorless discovered there were 796 death
OL,20,Fcertificates for children and babies
OL,21,Fwho died there, but no burial records.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
